          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jan 24 2025 22:47:50 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Detachment activation</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Once the system ready light is on, press and release the detachment button to begin the detachment process</li>\n<li>While current is flowing, the current flow indicator will illuminate solid green</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jan 27 2025 17:53:20 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
