          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #323232;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Detachment cycle complete</span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The cycle complete indicator will illuminate green when InZone Detachment System detects the cycle is complete</li>\n<li>Always check under fluoro after the cycle is complete</li>\n</ul>\n",
